Challenge material, included unchanged
--------------------------------------
The synthetic data in `Data/` and the starter kit in `starter-kit/` were produced by Stefania Stan
(https://www.linkedin.com/in/stefania-s/), challenge author and information owner. They are included with her
permission. They are not covered by the licence of this project's own code, and they are not ours to relicense.

A few figures of the fictional persona (savings, rent, goals) and of the starter kit (salaries, expenses) are
quoted in `engine/assumptions.py` and `engine/scenarios/alexia.json`, each with its source file.

`starter-kit/README.md` refers to a NOTICE.md file and a resources/ folder from the original challenge repository.
They are not included here. The rights for the challenge materials included in this repository are those stated
in this NOTICE and in DISCLAIMER.md.

